{"unit_id": "tag:0244:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节证明“仿射（affine）态射（morphisms）满足 fpqc 覆盖（coverings）的下降（descent）”。以下是正式陈述。\n\n", "allowed_english": ["fpqc"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "态射的仿射性，待决"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "仿射态射，待决"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "fpqc 覆盖，待决"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降", "context": "仿射态射的下降，待决"}], "notes": []}
